  featureUnlockRewards: []
  clientName: Ronan
  jobDescription: Open Rivermere's southern connection with a safe 100-meter bridge
    spanning roads at different elevations. Accommodate the heavy vehicle and observe
    the structural response, including shear forces near the supports, throughout the crossing.
  budget: 2000
  liveLoadWeight: 50
  bridgeSpan: 100
  allowedMaterials: []
  hiddenTools: []
  hiddenMaterials: []
  enforceMaxStress: 0
  maxAllowedStress: 100
  isTimeAttack: 0
  timeAttackDuration: 60
  winCondition: 0
  requiredIntactTime: 5
  goldReward: 500
  expReward: 100
  offerDialogue:
    name: Ronan
    sentences:
    - "You've got a <b><#E09500>100-meter</color></b> gap, different road elevations, and a heavy vehicle to accommodate."
    - "It won't be an easy crossing, but you've handled some challenging projects already."
    - Take your time, study the requirements, and build something that works.
    - "I trust your judgment, {PlayerName}. If you're ready, take the contract."
  continueOfferDialogue:
    name: Ronan
    sentences: []
  reminderDialogue:
    name: Ronan
    sentences:
    - "<b><#E09500>Pay attention to the shear forces near the supports during testing. Remember, the entire bridge needs to remain safe</color></b>."
  finishedContractDialogue:
    name: Ronan
    sentences:
    - "Well done, {PlayerName}. The southern connection is finally open."
    - "You've made a real difference here in Rivermere."
    - "From here, the road leads toward <b><#E09500>Ironhaven</color></b> in the <b><#E09500>Industrial Zone</color></b>."
    - "I hear they've got some challenging projects waiting there."
    - Take care out there, and good luck with your next adventure!
